Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:03:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] t113: add t113-zgl_board openwrt target (lunch entry +
 defconfig)

- vendorsetup.sh: add_lunch_combo t113-zgl_board
- defconfig: adbd enabled, wirelesscommon/wpa-cli/iw/wpad-basic,
  evtest + i2c-tools for peripheral testing (phase-3)
- base-files/rc.local: amixer HPOUT/MIC3 routing
- target/t113-common/modules.mk untouched here

defconfig current state is for phase-3 (touch); WiFi/BT packages
come in phase-4/5.
